      "value": "this should have been fixed in the latest sdk, but it appears you already have that. it's possible that the foot colliders were generated by the old sdk and the new one simply hasn't touched them yet. could you try touching the inspector by toggling mirror mode or moving the positions around?that should make it enforce the new, fixed behavior.",
