      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Did some more testing today to gather information for the post. \nPut a Foot L and R contact sender on the avatars right hand to test the receivers and it was detected correctly.\nThen hopped into a second account to test other avatars feet. I used a older public avatar that has not been uploaded with the beta sdk. So feet colliders are being created in client. It has the same issue not detecting the correct foot. image below shows the avatars right foot being detected as left.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
