      "value": "Tested again with build 1186 with sdk 2022.04.02.00.45.\ndeleted the old sdk folder restarted unity and imported the newest sdk. deleted and readded the avatar descriptor making sure to check the colliders for the feet were separated and on the correct foot.\nThe receivers still detected the incorrect foot so this is still a issue.",
