      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Tested again in build: 1189\nMade a new project with the latests sdk and made a new avatar id: avtr_32e284cb-2a71-4fc4-8039-81b08a772bd1\nVideo: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pryVfRdCsm4\nsince dev's i dont think are currently looking into this the issue is the generated contact senders for the feet have their tags inverted. so this issue is not just for avatars made with the sdk but also vrchats automated setup for old avatars.",
